- `den.lib.aspects.resolveImports` — same walk but skips entity instantiation (phases 1–3 only); `resolveWithPaths` / `resolveWithState` — same run plus the per-scope path set / full pipeline state; `den.lib.aspects.fx` — the low-level nix-effects pipeline if you want custom assembly.
