**1. Add the overlay flake as an input**

```nix
inputs.rust-overlay.url = "github:<owner>/<rust-overlay-flake>";
```

**2. Define an aspect that applies the overlay, and include it for all hosts**

```nix
# modules/rust.nix
{ inputs, den, ... }: {
  den.aspects.rust = {
    nixos.nixpkgs.overlays = [ (inputs.rust-overlay.lib.overlay) ];
