  };

  # activate for EVERY host
  den.schema.host.includes = [ den.aspects.rust ];
}
```

`inputs` is available in every module via `specialArgs.inputs`, so referencing the other flake's overlay from inside the aspect works as-is (in a non-flake npins/with-inputs setup, `inputs` is the same attrset from your `sources`).

